{"id":"8665bbc504ca9fb6","group":"92","path":"92/92-thm-halting-undecidable.md","title":"Halting Problem Undecidable","display":"thm-halting-undecidable — Halting Problem Undecidable","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-thm-halting-undecidable","aliases":["92-thm-halting-undecidable"],"display":"thm-halting-undecidable — Halting Problem Undecidable","depends_on":["[[92-df-halting-set]]","[[92-df-decidable-set]]"],"source":"第 IV 章附录 pp. 53–54（PDF 70–71）为相关背景；本文为本地计算模型补充","source_status":"本地停机问题扩展"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-thm-halting-undecidable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-thm-halting-undecidable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-halting-undecidable — Halting Problem Undecidable"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"06a154edf19ea063\" href=\"?note=06a154edf19ea063\" title=\"92-df-halting-set\">92-df-halting-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b090f61b9f3ec664\" href=\"?note=b090f61b9f3ec664\" title=\"92-df-decidable-set\">92-df-decidable-set</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"第 IV 章附录 pp. 53–54（PDF 70–71）为相关背景；本文为本地计算模型补充"},{"key":"source_status","html":"本地停机问题扩展"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\varphi_e)_{e\\in\\mathbb N}\">\\((\\varphi_e)_{e\\in\\mathbb N}\\)</span> (the fixed acceptable enumeration of unary partial-recursive functions)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K=\\{e\\in\\mathbb N\\mid e\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\varphi_e)\\}\">\\(K=\\{e\\in\\mathbb N\\mid e\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\varphi_e)\\}\\)</span> (diagonal halting set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"06a154edf19ea063\" href=\"?note=06a154edf19ea063\" title=\"92-df-halting-set\">92-df-halting-set</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Dec}\">\\(\\mathrm{Dec}\\)</span> (decidable-set predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b090f61b9f3ec664\" href=\"?note=b090f61b9f3ec664\" title=\"92-df-decidable-set\">92-df-decidable-set</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}halting\\text{-}undecidable} \\vdash \\neg\\mathrm{Dec}(K)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}halting\\text{-}undecidable} \\vdash \\neg\\mathrm{Dec}(K)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\mathrm{Dec}(K)\">\\(\\neg\\mathrm{Dec}(K)\\)</span> : 停机集不可判定</li>\n<li>停机问题：判断程序<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>在输入<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>上是否停机</li>\n<li>不可判定证明：对角化论证\n<ul>\n<li>若<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span>可判定，则其总特征函数<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_K\">\\(\\chi_K\\)</span>可计算</li>\n<li>构造一元程序<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\">\\(q\\)</span>：输入<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span>时，若<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_K(e)=1\">\\(\\chi_K(e)=1\\)</span>则发散，否则停机；由可接受枚举，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q=\\varphi_d\">\\(q=\\varphi_d\\)</span>对某个指标<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\">\\(d\\)</span>成立</li>\n<li>在输入<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\">\\(d\\)</span>上得到<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\\in K\\Longleftrightarrow d\\notin K\">\\(d\\in K\\Longleftrightarrow d\\notin K\\)</span>，矛盾</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>这是递归论的核心结果</li>\n<li>将本结果转移到某个理论的定理码集，必须另行给出方向正确的可计算归约以及该理论的有效性条件</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Source\">[Source]</h2>\n<p>这里的对角集合与有效编号是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"06a154edf19ea063\" href=\"?note=06a154edf19ea063\" title=\"92-df-halting-set\">92-df-halting-set</a> 的计算模型对象；给定 PDF 未给图灵机停机对角证明。原书自指不完备性可与其类比，但此命题作为本地背景保留。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Source","text":"[Source]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-halting-set","status":"resolved","id":"06a154edf19ea063","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-halting-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-decidable-set","status":"resolved","id":"b090f61b9f3ec664","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-decidable-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-halting-set","status":"resolved","id":"06a154edf19ea063","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$K=\\{e\\in\\mathbb N\\mid e\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\varphi_e)\\}$ (diagonal halting set, see [[92-df-halting-set]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-decidable-set","status":"resolved","id":"b090f61b9f3ec664","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Dec}$ (decidable-set predicate, see [[92-df-decidable-set]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-halting-set","status":"resolved","id":"06a154edf19ea063","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Source]","excerpt":"这里的对角集合与有效编号是 [[92-df-halting-set]] 的计算模型对象；给定 PDF 未给图灵机停机对角证明。原书自指不完备性可与其类比，但此命题作为本地背景保留。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"(\\varphi_e)_{e\\in\\mathbb N}","display":false},{"tex":"K=\\{e\\in\\mathbb N\\mid e\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\varphi_e)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Dec}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}halting\\text{-}undecidable} \\vdash \\neg\\mathrm{Dec}(K)","display":true},{"tex":"\\neg\\mathrm{Dec}(K)","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"K","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi_K","display":false},{"tex":"q","display":false},{"tex":"e","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi_K(e)=1","display":false},{"tex":"q=\\varphi_d","display":false},{"tex":"d","display":false},{"tex":"d","display":false},{"tex":"d\\in K\\Longleftrightarrow d\\notin K","display":false}],"bytes":1738,"backlinks":[{"id":"828452ef97907ed6","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"1003ce3e4d1c6eaa","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"07c01766ddf08181","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"若 I_𝒫 有判定器，输入 h(e) 并将性质真假与空集的固定真假比较，就能判定 e∈K，与 [[92-thm-halting-undecidable]] 矛盾。外延性确保性质只取决于 W_h(e)，而不是程序文本或运行速度。该证明没有声称能算法选出 B；固定任一非平凡性的见证即可。"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-278","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-thm-halting-undecidable]]"}],"outgoing":["06a154edf19ea063","b090f61b9f3ec664"]}